CONTEXT.md:60:| Block | What it is | Allowed to satisfy the rule? |
CONTEXT.md:62:| `.counter` | The chapter's advice, followed correctly by capable people, failing | **Yes** — this is the rule |
CONTEXT.md:63:| `.aftermath` | What became of the idea or market later. Illuminates the case. | **No** |
CONTEXT.md:64:| `.limit` | A real case that qualifies the advice without falsifying it — the advice half-followed, or followed against a subsidiary claim | **No** |
CONTEXT.md:65:| `.owed` | A visible note that the counter-case has not been found, saying what it would have to be | **No — but it is the honest fallback** |
